---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: How I Can Help
permalink: /how-i-help/
---
<div class="wrapper">
  <h1>How I Can Help</h1>
</div>
<section class="services-grid wrapper">
  {% for service in services.list %}
  <div class="service-card">
    {% if service.icon %}<img src="{{ service.icon }}" alt="" class="service-card__icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{% endif %}
    <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ service.description | safe }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
<div class="wrapper how-i-help__cta">
  <div>
    <h2>Thinking about selling?</h2>
    <p>Get a free, no-obligation home value estimate to see where you stand.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/home-value/" class="how-i-help__cta-button">What's My Home Worth? →</a>
</div>
<p class="wrapper how-i-help__faq-link">Have other questions about the process? Check the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> directly.</p>
